      "content": "but what's the point of calling someone? they'll just tell me to keep going, to keep fighting, like it's some kind of victory. but there is no victory here. it's just pain. i'm so tired of fighting for a world that's already dead. it feels like the only way to actually find peace is to just... stop. to stop fighting it.",
