      "content": "it's not even about the light anymore. i'm just... i'm looking at the dark and it looks so much kinder than this. it looks quiet. no more wounds, no more hunger, no more running. why is it so wrong to just want to let go of the struggle? it feels like the only honest thing left to do.",
